   * @param useCase - Use case slug (e.g., 'hotel', 'car-wash', 'ev-charging')
   * @param data - Use case specific data
   * @returns Power calculation result
   * 
   * @example
   * const hotelPower = QuoteEngine.calculatePower('hotel', { 
   *   rooms: 150, 
